# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Playwright Python {{FRAMEWORK}} {{TESTING_TYPE}} framework using pytest{{PYTHON_BDD_LABEL}}. Change `environment` in `config/run.config.json`; any matching `test-data/<environment>.json` is discovered automatically. Run all tests with `python -m pytest`, one sample file with `python -m pytest {{PYTHON_SAMPLE_FILE}}`, or a tag with `python -m pytest -m smoke`. Reusable helpers live in `utils/common_methods.py`. Install with `python -m pip install -r requirements.txt && python -m playwright install`.
